# React & feature patterns

## Components

- Functional components only; named exports preferred (`export function HomePage`).
- Colocate feature UI under `features/<name>/`; export from `index.ts`.
- Shared layout stays in `components/layout`; icons/primitives in `components/ui`.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib` for conditional class names.

## Data in UI

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<a href="mailto:Info@Venusestates.In">...</a>

// ✅ GOOD
import { site } from '@/content'
<a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>
```

## Routing

- Routes defined only in `src/app/router`.
- Pages consume Layout via `<Outlet />`; do not re-import Navbar/Footer on each page.
- Use `toRoutePath()` when mapping `site` paths into `<Route path>`.

## Styling

- Tailwind utility classes + tokens from `styles/index.css`.
- Prefer existing tokens (`bg-ink`, `text-accent`, `bg-footer`, `font-display`) over one-off hex in JSX.
